","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1110406002","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"阿尔萨，如果他们发难，就躲进我身后——","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1110406003:1":{"key":"say:4:1110406003:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1110406003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"索恩，欢迎回归！还有阿尔萨！两位蛮血勇士的英名已经传遍...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:6:1110406003":{"key":"choice_prompt:6:1110406003","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1110406003","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"索恩，欢迎回归！还有阿尔萨！两位蛮血勇士的英名已经传遍了沙漠！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1110406004:1":{"key":"say:7:1110406004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1110406004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"怎么回事？我们被押送过来，实在没想到还能享受这种待遇……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1110406005:1":{"key":"say:8:1110406005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_t